B.bel=new A.J(B.Y9,["The first biting cold of winter begins.","The deepest cold passes as the new year approaches.","The threshold of spring and a time to welcome good fortune.","Ice thaws and spring rain brings new sprouts.","Life awakens from its winter sleep.","Day and night are equal; spring is at its center.","Clear skies and bright new growth.","Spring rain nourishes the grain.","Summer begins and the fields turn deep green.","Sunlight fills the growing grain.","A time to plant and tend new life.","The longest day and the fullest sunlight.","The first heat of summer arrives.","Heat peaks and the fruit ripens.","Autumn begins with a cool breeze.","The summer heat finally subsides.","Dew gathers in the cool morning air.","Day and night are equal; autumn is at its center.","Dew turns cold as autumn deepens.","Frost arrives and the leaves begin to fall.","Winter begins and nature rests.","The first light snow falls.","Deep snow covers the land.","The longest night and the return of light."],t.w)
